    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng iri báy, ‹Tlaa/aá tsár awa parereehhayen awa adór kudaá geera hhasleek, nee sandakmoó tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen kway bats tleehheek. Daqaní ni hardát amor'eé', gawaakaá tlooma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng /aymi'iidá' gawaá tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen awa geerá, kudá' kuúng taa giqeér i gooiím, daqaní tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen ki báts baraá sandakmo.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Naagáy sandakmo nguri tleéhh ar xa'anoó masqaryaandi, nee tlaa/aá parereehhayen awa tsár awa adór kudaá geera. Gawaá adoorihe tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen ngiri gawaá dabaaeé' óh, ngiri ar tsa/ám ay gawaá tlooma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ axweesanoó adór kuduú geera guri gawaá tlaa/eedá' parereehhayenií gooín, hara'aydudá' mibaangw, kudá' aa káh bál iwa gawaá tloomár wa axweés, baraá tla/ángw asla. Aluuwo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen ngiri haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niri alií warqáw niri aweér gawaá tloomaro, nee adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó', tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen ngiri qaás baraá guruú sandakmoodá' naa tleéhh, adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira hara'ayín.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli aaii'ín gina tseék iimír hhaleeraá múk Ya'akani wa tleemu ay Mosera. Diirí kawa áy Aroni iri gwaá' kuri foól. Garmaawós Eleasari kuri kitaangós wa qaás, tawa kahaamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tawa diirí wa tláy, tari kumiít ay Gudgoda, nee tari Gudgodár wa tláy ay Yotbata, yaamaá ló'wa duxér koomá' ar ma'aá yaariir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk tlahhoó Laáwi guri tsawaár as tawa múk sandakmooduú alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gu loohiís, nee tawa gadiyuusi dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale, nee muu kuwa tsuuqadá' i hanmiisi ar umuuwós tam ay laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, múk tlahhoó Laáwi yaamaá ta aali i kahhiyá' dinkwa nee hhaeeín, inooín gár ta slay a ilaiwa/amér tawa kaahamuusér Mungú, adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ngira al'axweés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aníng ana gawaá tloomár wa hoót deelo mibeeri tsiyáhh xweera nee tlaatla/aango adoodá' aáng geeraawo naa tleéhh. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa'aá hatlae ina male iiárií qaás, nee iri ya/án as munduwa hhaamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy iri báy, ‹Tláw, muu geerahareek baraá aaiiwo, as tawa dahi baraá yaamuudá' naa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa dír baabi'ii'ín i haniis.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám daxta kuungá' múk Israeli, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng gár i slai a milá dirhunge? Aqo har AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng un ilaiwawa/á', nee lohduuwós sleémeero kudá' i slai kiwa eehada', nee kuwa sla'a', nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kuwa sagadiyusa' ar munerhúng sleémeero, nee qeereemohúng sleémeero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee hara'ayduuwós kiwa ota' nee dabér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng tidá' laarí nuwa hara'ayiim, as kuungá' diihhooa kawa sleera'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aawaak, doori tam dooraá doori a daqaari'iimár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, yaamu nee muruudá' sleémeero baraadá' i diriia a kós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ slám baabi'iirén aáng gina ló'wa slaá', nee kuungaá xwaylar'ín nuri tsawaár, kitángw múk hatlá' sleémeerowo, an adoodá' tam ay laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe munerhúng hheehhe'eesaak nee ma ki/aara' saga gawduuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng inós an Munguú munguaá hatlá' gi baál, nee inós an Aakoó bariise. Inós an Munguú úr nee oo /uuruú koóm nee oo dae tlaáq, inós i barqaantír konká laqaá i slukumár /ayiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós gan'amu guna tlehhiít dír na/aá panaay nee kwaeeli, inós sleeme heé dahaaymo gun slaa', nee guri muruú /ayma nee tsitáy hanmiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé', daxta dahaaye sla'aak, asma aáng kuungá' sleeme a dahaaye baraá yaamaá Misriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ilaiwaa/aak, inós sagadiyusaak, ti alkoomakonde' nee inós, nee lo'o ka /agá' ar umuuwós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós an xirfuuhúng, an Munguúhúng kudá' naa muruuwí urén i tleehh, nee oo waa/oo/amo kudá' taa aandé' ilahunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabi'iihúng qoomár niwa baraá yaamaá Misrír i tlayé', inooín an muu mibeeri faanqw kilós, ala hám daxta AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng naa tlahhás adór tsatse/uú gawaá doori.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
